  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/IYtubaSAS9B_I-_VHoJuIo93YIPa5VI5ha3u9RLc9Eo.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\nFrom figure $\\mathrm{I}_{1}=\\frac{\\mathrm{I}}{4}$ and $\\mathrm{I}_{2}=\\frac{9 \\mathrm{I}}{64}$\r\n\r\n$\\begin{aligned} \\text { By using } \\frac{\\mathrm{I}_{\\max }}{\\mathrm{I}_{\\min }} &=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{I}_{2}}{\\mathrm{I}_{1}}}+1}{\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{I}_{2}}{\\mathrm{I}_{1}}}-1}\\right)^{2} \\\\ &=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac{9}{16}}+1}{\\sqrt{\\frac{9}{16}}-1}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{49}{1} \\end{aligned}$",
